# Evidence and runtime state.
#
# Leading slashes matter: `data/evidence_vault/` matched only the repository root,
# so `backend/data/evidence_vault/` was never ignored and 31,817 uploaded contract
# PDFs from local test runs were staged for a public push. Anchored patterns are
# written explicitly now, and the bare directory names catch every nesting level.
data/
**/data/evidence_vault/
**/chroma/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Generated analysis artefacts — rebuildable, and large.
graphify-out/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
